      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "After deciding to go solar, I researched the many available options, currently in the market place. I was looking for a local company that displayed high levels of professionalism. After consulting with a couple of other companies,I settled on Naked Energy as, from the first contact with them, I was impressed with their staffs knowledge and attention to detail. Nothing was too much trouble and the staff were extremely helpful with ensuring all the paperwork, etc was completed properly and submitted promptly. Installation of the system was scheduled and expertly installed within a matter of weeks.The only issue was with the Wi-Fi connection on the inverter and to their credit, the Company Director took time out of his weekend to visit and rectify the issue.If you want to deal with a solar company that represents value for money, honesty and integrity and good old fashioned customer service, Naked Energy is for you.",
