      "review_date_formatted": "",
      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "Have had our 5.5kw system running for over 6 months now and couldn't be happier.  Normally I hate a visit rather than a quote over the phone, but I loved the walk through that assessed our current use and ways to optimize use after install.  The detailed page of what savings we could expect were realistic, with an estimated high/low savings (4.4-6.6yrs breakeven) giving a good range of outcomes - and so far we are ahead of the best case scenario.  They are open to negotiation and offer several levels of both panels and inverters, and providing spec sheets+model numbers that allows me time to come to sites like this to check the quality of the gear.There was no push or pressure, and certainly none of the \"decide today\" crap or pestering phone calls (*cough* euro solar), just good complete information that fit with the info on this site.  There was an inverter issue a few weeks in, but it was replaced quickly (in a few days) after it was brought to their attention.  Just outstanding",
      "value_for_money_rating": 4.0,
