      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "The installers showed up on time and got straight to work and 4 hours later the system was operational. We did have a failure of the inverter the next day. I work in an industry where you get a certain percentage of equipment failures within hours or days or even failure to start so I just called the supplier who sent the installer straight away. Once they confirmed the issues was a faulty inverter they replaced it the next day. Great service. The Naked Energy rep then booked a time to run through the system operation with me and I will see him again in 6 months for a follow up.Solar Quotes gave me 3 competitive quotes and all vendors followed up on their quotes without trying to hassle me for a sale. Happy to recommend them.",
